      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "t",
          "text": [
            "It started with looking out a window at workers on scaffolding. Something about the perspective and fluidity of their movement caught my attention. Hundreds of people build the massive structures we live in, yet they remain practically invisible."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "t",
          "text": [
            "The idea was to accumulate their motion over time, gradually revealing the building as they work. Every gesture leaves a trace. The final piece is the sum of their labor made visible."
          ]
        },
